WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.803
So sometimes when I'm out
with friends at a quiet restaurant,

00:00:03.843 --> 00:00:07.431
I have a really hard time focusing
on what people are saying.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:12.144
The tinnitus just gets annoying,
and then I can't really focus on things,

00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:16.983
and I end up missing jokes and conversation
pieces, and after a while it just

00:00:17.023 --> 00:00:22.210
gets so annoying to me that I know that I'm
really not the best dinner companion.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.965
And then after I get home,
I'm just angry and depressed because

00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:31.090
I feel like the tinnitus
is interfering with my social life.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.012
And I'm a social person,
so it's important to me.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:41.078
So I know I can't get rid of tinnitus,
but I thought about my situation and realized

00:00:41.118 --> 00:00:45.640
that maybe my friends just don't know
what's going on inside my own head.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.294
And so I talked to them all,
and I explained what happens

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:53.140
when we go out to dinner,
and it changed everything.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.876
You know, now my friends
talk to me directly,

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:59.477
and if they notice that I can't pay
attention to what they're saying,

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:02.320
then they make eye contact
with me and repeat things,

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:06.007
and it makes me feel like I'm
more a part of the conversation.
